<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc1">JUDE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jd</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Jude, yon sèvitè-atache nèt a Jésus Kri, epi frè la a Jacques, ekri a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:6">Wo 1:6</ref></char></note>sa yo ki rele sen nan Bondye, Papa a, epi ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:11">Jn 17:11</ref></char></note>konsève pou Jésus Kri.<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Ke mizerikòd la, lapè, ak lamou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:2">I Pi 1:2</ref></char></note>ogmante anvè nou.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Byeneme yo, pandan mwen t ap fè tout efò pou ekri nou selon delivrans ke nou pataje ansanm, mwen te sanse ke m te bezwen ekri nou epi plede avèk nou ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:12">I Tim 6:12</ref></char></note>lite fò pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:7">Trav 6:7</ref></char></note>lafwa ki te delivre yon fwa pou tout a sen yo. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Paske gen sèten moun yo ki te glise antre nan mitan nou san ke nou pa wè, sa yo ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:8">I Pi 2:8</ref></char></note>fin make pou kondanasyon sila depi avan lè; moun san Bondye ki ta vire lagras Bondye nou pou vini yon lisans pou fè sa ki mal, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:12">I Tim 2:12</ref></char></note>rejete sèl Mèt ak Senyè nou, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Koulye a, mwen vle fè nou sonje, malgre ke nou deja konnen tout bagay yo nèt, ke Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Egz 12:51</ref></char></note>apre Li te delivre yon pèp sòti nan Égypte, apre te detwi tout sa yo ki pa t kwè. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:4">II Pi 2:4</ref></char></note>zanj yo ki pa t kenbe pwòp wòl yo, men te abandonnen pwòp plas yo, Li te kenbe byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:9">II Pi 2:9</ref></char></note>anchennen anba tenèb la, pou jijman a nan gran jou a. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Menm jan ke Sodome ak Gomorrhe ansanm ak vil yo ki te antoure yo, akoz ke yo fè menm bagay, epi te antre nan imoralite a byen lèd, epi t ap chache vis lachè yo ki pa t menm twouve nan nati, se prezante kon yon egzanp, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:41">Mat 25:41</ref></char></note> pase nan pinisyon dife etènèl a.<verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Malgre sa, moun sa yo fè menm bagay la. Ak rèv ke yo fè, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:10">II Pi 2:10</ref></char></note>defile lachè a, rejete otorite a, epi meprize zanj majestik yo. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:11">II Pi 2:11</ref></char></note>lakanj Michel, lè li te dispite avèk dyab la, epi te despite sou kò Moise la, pa t menm tante pwononse yon jijman cho, men te di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Za 3:2</ref></char></note>“Ke Bondye bay ou repwòch.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:12">II Pi 2:12</ref></char></note>moun sa yo meprize sa ke yo pa menm konprann. Konsa, se pa bagay yo ke yo konnen pa lensten, kon bèt ki pa ka menm rezonen, ke yo vin detwi.<verse eid="JUD 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Malè a yo! Paske yo ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Jen 4:3-8</ref></char></note>menm jan avèk Caïn. Pou yon salè yo te kouri tèt an avan nan erè Balaam nan, epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-3">Nonb 16:1-3</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 16:31-35">31-35</ref></char></note>peri nan rebelyon Koré a.<verse eid="JUD 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Moun sa yo se resif yo k ap kashe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:20">I Kor 11:20</ref></char></note>nan fèt lamou sen nou yo, lè yo vin fète avèk nou san fè lakrent, men konsène sèlman ak pwòp tèt pa yo. Yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:14">Pwov 25:14</ref></char></note>nwaj yo ki san dlo, pote pa van a, bwa sezon fwèt la san fwi, de fwa mò, dechouke menm; <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:20">És 57:20</ref></char></note>volas lanmè sovaj yo, k ap kimen nan pwòp wont yo tout kalite lenpirite yo; zetwal erann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:17">II Pi 2:17</ref></char></note>pou kilès tenèb nwa a te rezève jis pou janmen.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Epi selon sa yo tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">Jen 5:18</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 5:21">21</ref></char></note>Énoch nan setyèm jenerasyon Adam, te fè pwofesi e te di “Byen gade, Senyè a te vini avèk anpil milye yo a moun sen pa Li yo, <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>pou egzekite jijman sou tout, epi pou fè rann kont a tout enkwayan yo avèk zak enpi pa yo, ke yo t ap fè nan yon jan ki san respè Bondye, epi tout move bagay ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:9">I Tim 1:9</ref></char></note>pechè yo san fwa te pale kont Li.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:11">Nonb 16:11</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 16:41">41</ref></char></note>moun k ap plenyen fò nan gòj, k ap toujou twouve fòt, epi k ap swiv pwòp lanvi lachè pa yo. Yo pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:18">II Pi 2:18</ref></char></note>avèk awogans, flatè moun, pou yo kapab gen yon avantaj.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Men nou, byeneme yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:2">II Pi 3:2</ref></char></note>dwe sonje pawòl yo ki te pale oparavan pa apot a Senyè nou yo, Jésus Kri <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>ke yo t ap di a nou ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:29">Trav 20:29</ref></char></note>“Nan dènye tan, ap gen mokè yo, k ap swiv pwòp lanvi pa yo san fwa nan Bondye.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Se sa yo ki lakòz a divizyon yo, moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:1">I Kor 2:1</ref></char></note>k ap reflechi kon lemonn lan, ki san Lespri a.<verse eid="JUD 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Men nou, byeneme yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:7">Kol 2:7</ref></char></note>an nou bati sou lafwa ki sen pase tout; epi priye nan Lespri Sen an. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Kenbe nou menm nan lamou Bondye, epi toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:13">Tit 2:13</ref></char></note>tan swayezman pou mizerikòd a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri anvè lavi etènèl. <verse eid="JUD 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Fè mizerikòd sou kèk k ap doute, <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>sove lòt. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:11">Am 4:11</ref></char></note>Rachte yo menm nan dife a ak laperèz, epi sou kèk fè mizerikòd avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:3">Za 3:3</ref></char></note>rayisman menm pou rad ki te salè pa lachè.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Koulye a, a Li menm ki kapab kenbe nou pou nou pa tonbe, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:14">II Kor 4:14</ref></char></note>fè nou kanpe nan prezans laglwa Li san fòt avèk gran jwa, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:44">Jn 5:44</ref></char></note>sèl Bondye Sovè nou an, atravè Jésus Kri Senyè nou, se laglwa, majeste, pwisans, ak otorite, menm avan tout tan, rive Koulye a, epi jis pou janmen. Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
